          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagwanisha imiheto barasa umwami Yosiya; aca abwira abakuru b’ingabo biwe ati: “Nimunkure hano kuko nkomeretse cane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bamukura mu mukogote wiwe, bamushira mu wundi mukogote yari afise bamujana i Yerusalemu, apfirayo. Bamuhamba mu mva za ba sekuruza, maze Abayuda bose n’ab’i Yerusalemu baramuririra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
